---
description: >-
  The theme sets bpmn.eventStrokeWidth to 1.6, the value the theme would use
  anyway. Because the author set it, every non-end ring is drawn at 1.6px,
  the double rings of the intermediate and boundary events too, instead of
  their lighter notation weight of 1.4px.
config:
  themeVariables:
    bpmn:
      eventStrokeWidth: 1.6
---
bpmn-beta LR
  lane "Orders"
    start s1 "Order received"
    task t1 "Check stock"
      boundary timer b1 "2 days"
    intermediate timer i1 "Wait a day"
    end e1 "Order closed"
  s1 --> t1
  t1 --> i1
  i1 --> e1
